      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Fixed</h3><ul><li><code>@notchnotch/runtime</code> types now include the runtime globals (<code>setTimeout</code>, <code>setInterval</code>, <code>console</code>…). In 0.3.0 a new project created with <code>npm create notchnotch-extension</code> failed <code>npm run typecheck</code>.</li></ul><h3>Changed</h3><ul><li>The SDK is published to npm with Trusted Publishing when it is configured, and release workflows run on Node 24.</li></ul>]]></description>
